istinct differences create big clashes between these various tribes. When a mysterious threat puts all of the Trolls across the land in danger, Poppy, Branch, and their band of friends must embark on an epic quest to create harmony among the feuding Trolls to unite them against certain doom.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":901362,\"title\":\"Trolls Band Together\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bkpPTZUdq31UGDovmszsg2CchiI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mDW6z7I6de6JbUgPOkAEZwKbg7G.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Branch's brother, Floyd, is kidnapped for his musical talents by a pair of nefarious pop-star villains, Branch and Poppy embark on a harrowing and emotional journey to reunite the other brothers and rescue Floyd from a fate even worse than pop-culture obscurity.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1584,\"title\":\"The School of Rock\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zXLXaepIBvFVLU25DH3wv4IPSbe.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k5MTAtE9CCi5TWA84qaFMYv3ajB.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Fired from his band and hard up for cash, guitarist and vocalist Dewey Finn finagles his way into a job as a fifth-grade substitute teacher at a private school, where he secretly begins teaching his straight-A students the finer points of rock 'n' roll and the power of sticking it to the man. But as the school’s stern principal closes in and the Battle of the Bands looms, Dewey must risk everything to prove that rock 'n' roll can change lives.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":254470,\"title\":\"Pitch Perfect 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fQaEGzFmvTYu3G641WV0Tg9auAt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bWOfRV1Ubk9SWEDZDDjsmIUCcbZ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Bellas are back, and they are better than ever. After being humiliated in front of none other than the President of the United States of America, the Bellas are taken out of the Aca-Circuit. In order to clear their name, and regain their status, the Bellas take on a seemingly impossible task: winning an international competition no American team has ever won. In order to accomplish this monumental task, they need to strengthen the bonds of friendship and sisterhood and blow away the competition with their amazing aca-magic! With all new friends and old rivals tagging along for the trip, the Bellas can hopefully accomplish their dreams.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":23398,\"title\":\"Alvin and the Chipmunks: The Squeakquel\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A2tgUeWadVJs1g6zOCZgKRs8uWC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3lf6YCItKcF3Wrrs7tp1PL0eyOT.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Pop sensations Alvin, Simon and Theodore end up in the care of Dave Seville's twenty-something nephew Toby. The boys must put aside music super stardom to return to school, and are tasked with saving the school's music program by winning the $25,000 prize in a battle of the bands. But the Chipmunks unexpectedly meet their match in three singing chipmunks known as The Chipettes - Brittany, Eleanor and Jeanette. Romantic and musical sparks are ignited when the Chipmunks and Chipettes square off.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":342473,\"title\":\"Ballerina\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qBxMhcmNnFniuDAZTKEHcSgKtsn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wlLdcK3Sm7zp0w1ZuVvnFlmcchM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1879 Paris, a young orphan dreams of becoming a ballerina and flees her rural Brittany for Paris, where she passes for someone else and accedes to the position of pupil at the Grand Opera house.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1504358,\"title\":\"Don't Say Good Luck\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dgTKahWonzVLeN8Lm22WR2S7D0A.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yzdMGn8IRHSGuV8AIzw19wkRU2W.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Sophie Birenbaum is ready for the spotlight as the lead in her high school musical—until she's suddenly facing more drama at home than on the stage.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Music\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":507566,\"title\":\"First You Dream: The Music of Kander & Ebb\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4F7DPe4CUeheHdtOCvVlNuZMHl.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":9.5,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An all-star cast performs the music of John Kander and Fred Ebb; songs include \\\"New York, New York\\\" and \\\"Cabaret.\\\"\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":694672,\"title\":\"Celebrating 25 Magical Years of Disney on Broadway\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yXmt13BHuut2sA3hZZ6nblBcb9P.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":8,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Enjoy a special stream of Broadway Cares/Equity Fights AIDS’ benefit concert celebrating Disney on Broadway’s 25th anniversary. The online playback will raise money for Broadway Cares’ COVID-19 Emergency Assistance Fund, which is helping everyone in the theater and performing arts community impacted by the pandemic and work shutdown.  Ryan McCartan (Frozen) hosted the stream live from his family’s home and will interview special Disney on Broadway stars, from their homes, throughout the evening.  The show also included a much-anticipated, high-energy reunion of 18 Newsies from the show’s Broadway and national touring productions, and a moving performance from Broadway Inspirational Voices.  The November concert was directed by Casey Hushion. James Abbott was the music director and created the revised orchestrations. Howard Joines was the orchestra coordinator. The creative team included lighting designer Ryan J. O’Gara and sound designers Kurt Fischer and Marie Renee Foucher.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1318848,\"title\":\"Tina Turner - My Songs. My Life\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vHsSXdqd7eePDCVdphXsMryF1LU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/182EgnNmaFGVXmBV2Sg5YwyuoLs.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Hardly any other world star has left such a profound mark on people's hearts and on music history. This documentary traces the influence of an exceptional artist and follows the paths she paved for a new generation of Black artists.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"PAO4FGObR_s\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"2CCC5wXiXA4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"W0CDpzTBC60\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}